//! chess-rules: the pure rules library (SDD-chess-rules). Part A (chess-a0r.2.3): positions, FEN,
//! legal move generation, position-level draw and game-end predicates, perft (DD-RUL-001 to
//! 004, 007, 008, 014, 015). Part B (chess-a0r.2.4): SAN, the move-text parser, PGN reader and
//! writer, line text, `canonical_form` and the raw `ECO` tag (DD-RUL-005, 006, 009 to 012, 016).
//! The ECO table and `eco::lookup` (DD-RUL-013, IFP-RUL-6) are generated by `build.rs`.
//!
//! The crate does no I/O and holds no clock or random source. `shakmaty` types never appear in
//! the public API (D-3, DR-RUL-001): only the modules `position` and `fen` import it.
#![forbid(unsafe_code)]

